  "body": "The light dismiss paragraph mentions Esc key behavior used for auto popover light dismiss, but apparently it's not specified anywhere, see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#popover-light-dismiss.\r\n\r\nI suppose it should be simple as listen for keypress trusted event on a document and if Esc key was pressed and topmost auto popover is not null, then close it.",
